          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE 5/21 ASTON CLINTON LONDON ROAD (south side) No. 21 (Formerly listed as No.21 Minshulls) 25.10.51 -                                           II House. C18, painted brick, old tiled mansard roof; flanking chimneys gable and front parapets, 2 3-light sash dormers with lead tops. 1 storey and attic. 5 bays of sash windows with original glazing bars, flat headed wood frames under segmental brick arches. Ground floor windows have flush panelled shutters. Central 6 panelled flush door with rectangular fanlight having concentric and radiating glazing pattern, moulded architrave, flat cut brackets and moulded cornice. 4 stone steps. 1 bay wing to RH, 1 sash window, tiled roof. Double pile plan, rear elevation has 3 upper sashes, central one smaller, all with blind boxes. 1 storey modern rear wing. Listing NGR: SP8774112112"
    }
